# Frontend

Stack: React 19, Vite 7, TypeScript, React Router 7, Axios, ethers.js 6. Alias `@` → `frontend/src/`. Details: `frontend/AGENTS.md`.

## Structure

- Features live in `frontend/src/app/features/<name>/` with `hooks/`, `components/`, `api/` + main component.
- New authenticated page: feature folder → route in `App.tsx` under `MainLayout` → path/nav in `navigation/routes.ts` / `AppHeader` if needed.
- No Redux/Zustand — Context (`Web3AuthContext`) + local hooks.

## UI

- Landing (`.landing`) and app shell (`.app-shell`): Tailwind v4 only; tokens from `styles/tailwind.css`; reuse `@/shared/ui`.
- Auth pages (`/login`, `/register`, `/auth`): keep existing auth CSS — do not rewrite to Tailwind unless asked. No new SCSS.
- Missing backend/blockchain gaps: `MissingBackendNote` — do not fake APIs.
- Visual system for the whole frontend UI: follow skill `.cursor/skills/frontend-development/` (do not invent parallel button/heading systems).

## API / copy

- Call backend via feature `api/` helpers; proxy `/api` and `/Auth` in dev.
- User-facing UI copy: Polish. Honest product claims only (SHA-256, Sepolia, IPFS/Pinata, PDF ≤ 5 MB).
